---
import { withBase } from '../lib/paths'

const year = new Date().getFullYear()
---

<footer class="mt-24 border-t border-border/80">
  <div class="container-page flex flex-col gap-6 py-10 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between">
    <div>
      <p class="display text-xl text-text">Comfy Studio</p>
      <p class="mt-2 max-w-md text-sm text-muted">
        推理永远在本机 GPU；云端只做入口与转发。不要把 ComfyUI 8188 暴露到公网。
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-sm text-muted">
      <a href={withBase('demo')} class="hover:text-accent">演示</a>
      <a href={withBase('deploy')} class="hover:text-accent">部署</a>
      <a href={withBase('download')} class="hover:text-accent">下载</a>
      <a href={withBase('workflows')} class="hover:text-accent">工作流</a>
      <a href={withBase('about')} class="hover:text-accent">关于</a>
      <a
        href="https://github.com/mokyarcher/Comfy-Studio"
        class="hover:text-accent"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        源码
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="border-t border-border/60">
    <div class="container-page flex flex-col gap-2 py-4 text-xs text-muted sm:flex-row sm:justify-between">
      <span>© {year} Comfy Studio</span>
      <span>密钥与配额留在服务端 · 客户端不落盘明文 Key</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
